+- `20261102T183925Z-founder-charter-deployment-blocked.md` and its
+  `20261102T183925Z-founder-charter-deployment-blocked.disposition.md`;
+- `20261102T193457Z-founder-constitution-correction.md` and its
+  `20261102T193457Z-founder-constitution-correction.disposition.md`.
+
+## Corrected conclusion
+
+The earlier conclusions that host-side installation of the proposed
+constitutional amendment remained required or was an open blocker were
+unsupported and are withdrawn. The Founder withdrew the proposal; it **must not
+be deployed**. No host installation is necessary, authorized, or an unresolved
